## SS13 jobs for ported content.

job-name-imperial-geneticist = Geneticist
job-description-imperial-geneticist = Study and edit the crew's DNA at the genetics console: unlock mutations, make injectors and keep samples in the DNA vault.
job-name-imperial-virologist = Virologist
job-description-imperial-virologist = Isolate viruses from blood, breed symptoms in the PanD.E.M.I.C and make vaccines before an outbreak wipes out the station.
job-name-imperial-bitrunner = Bitrunner
job-description-imperial-bitrunner = Dive into virtual domains from the netpods, clear them and bring valuable loot back to reality for cargo.
job-name-imperial-xenobiologist = Xenobiologist
job-description-imperial-xenobiologist = Breed slimes, feed and cross them, harvest extracts and keep the herd from breaking out of the pens.
job-name-imperial-shaft-miner = Shaft Miner
job-description-imperial-shaft-miner = Descend to Lavaland, mine ore and deliver it to the station. Redeem your starting mining voucher for a gear kit at the mining vendor.

